<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1443711690"/></metadata></head><body dur="5:11.600"><div begin="14.926" end="40.529"><p begin="14.926" end="19.657" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.926" end="15.349">教友</span> <span begin="15.349" end="15.784">战友</span> <span begin="15.784" end="16.150">老友</span> <span begin="16.150" end="16.600">女友</span> <span begin="16.600" end="17.091">说个</span><span begin="17.091" end="17.506">笑</span><span begin="17.506" end="17.741">话</span><span begin="17.741" end="18.324">说</span><span begin="18.324" end="18.591">再</span><span begin="18.591" end="19.657">见</span></p><p begin="21.549" end="26.335" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.549" end="21.961">喊了</span> <span begin="21.961" end="22.411">痛了</span> <span begin="22.411" end="22.829">醉了</span> <span begin="22.829" end="23.661">说了再见</span> <span begin="23.661" end="24.111">让</span><span begin="24.111" end="24.344">往</span><span begin="24.344" end="24.944">事</span><span begin="24.944" end="25.179">如</span><span begin="25.179" end="26.335">烟</span></p><p begin="26.613" end="32.508" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.613" end="27.109">来</span><span begin="27.109" end="27.457">瞻</span><span begin="27.457" end="27.893">仰</span><span begin="27.893" end="28.325">乐</span><span begin="28.325" end="28.592">观</span><span begin="28.592" end="29.060">的</span><span begin="29.060" end="30.012">脸</span> <span begin="30.012" end="30.827">回忆</span><span begin="30.827" end="31.245">里</span><span begin="31.245" end="31.614">蔓</span><span begin="31.614" end="32.508">延</span></p><p begin="32.828" end="40.529" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.828" end="33.627">欢送</span><span begin="33.627" end="35.318">会</span> <span begin="36.550" end="37.070">有</span><span begin="37.070" end="37.871">我</span><span begin="37.871" end="38.739">的</span><span begin="38.739" end="39.642">笑</span><span begin="39.642" end="40.529">面</span></p></div><div begin="41.670" end="1:06.7